flowchart TD
  start([You open the app]) --> first{First visit or<br/>saved taste?}
  first -->|brand new| search[Search for tags you like]
  first -->|link has tags| pinned[Load posts matching<br/>those exact tags]
  first -->|returning user| warm[Load posts from<br/>your starter interests]
  search --> pinned

  pinned --> sort
  warm --> sort
  more --> sort

  sort[Drop duplicates · sort by<br/>how well tags match you ·<br/>push already-seen posts down] --> queue

  subgraph scrolling["While you scroll"]
    queue[(Posts queued ahead —<br/>about 10 ready to view)]
    look[You view a post]
    queue --> look --> choice{What did you do?}
    choice -->|liked| up[Tags on that post<br/>score higher]
    choice -->|unliked| down[Those tags score lower]
    choice -->|scrolled past after ~2s<br/>without liking| soft[Tags dip slightly]
    search --> interest[Search tells the app<br/>what you care about]
    interest --> taste
    up --> taste
    down --> taste
    soft --> taste
    taste[(Your taste profile —<br/>tag scores, history, favorites<br/>saved on this device)]
  end

  taste --> mode{Still filtering<br/>by search tags?}
  mode -->|yes| pinned
  mode -->|no — free browse| pick[Pick what to fetch next]
  pick -->|most of the time ~7/8| fav[Choose a tag you<br/>already like — by popularity]
  pick -->|sometimes ~1/8| try[Choose a tag you saw<br/>but barely engaged with]
  fav --> more[Fetch a batch of new posts]
  try --> more
